                    <div class="h-48 bg-coco-leaf flex items-center justify-center p-6 relative overflow-hidden">
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://www.transparenttextures.com/patterns/cubes.png')] opacity-10"></div>
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="w-36 h-36 drop-shadow-2xl z-10 transform group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500"><use href="#svg-coco-cortado"></use></svg>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-8 text-center">
                        <h3 class="font-display text-3xl text-gray-800 mb-2">Enano Verde de Brasil</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm font-bold text-coco-leaf uppercase mb-4 tracking-wider">El Rey del Agua</p>
                        <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">Su tronco es pequeño y grueso, facilitando la cosecha. Empiezan a producir cocos en apenas 3 años. Tienen menos pulpa pero contienen un <strong>agua extremadamente dulce y abundante</strong>.</p>
                        <div class="flex justify-center gap-2">
                            <span class="bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">Agua Dulce</span>
                            <span class="bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-xs px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">Palma Baja</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

